{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "a984b40130bcd9f26aa8b5cf42e64a5bdd8c69138f0cf1143be3a0f844571af2", "ja": "■「ここまでのあらすじ」画面内表示■", "zh": "■“前情提要”画面内显示■", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "a226f79c6b6ac5f1ed53d036c667810f68facd5e615e19b2acb2844ec16fc7a3", "ja": "Team2nd＆Team3rdによる、\n南の島でのデビューバトルイベントから数日後……", "zh": "由Team2nd与Team3rd带来的\n南方小岛出道对决活动过去几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "7a0d8d96f461d76573040a431abf2d35723c5b6a3e0915e0a91fb9c4800b56c3", "ja": "コホン。それじゃ、あらためて……。\nTeam2ndのみんな、おかえり！", "zh": "咳咳。那么，再重新说一遍……\nTeam2nd的各位，欢迎回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "89fc449eeadb4192ba263cdf42fc54b15dbff2ade163f352211fabc8b0728a5b", "ja": "たっだいまー☆", "zh": "我回来啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "12e9b8603d755c993113acb8d5a78b4dac41954ef6a61b70226702a5551b5516", "ja": "ただいま～♪", "zh": "我回来啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92", "ja": "ただいまー！", "zh": "我回来了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546", "ja": "ただいま戻りました。", "zh": "我回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "a28453e76b8119d521748f08c8349737587d5d8f8eee2dfaa1c843750e40c861", "ja": "た、ただいま…♪", "zh": "我、我回来了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "eeb12960fd946529470a4840e5177636af0fb52d5ebc2e9e933a41fe8814ad52", "ja": "デビューバトルイベント、いろいろ大変だったな。\n予想外なこともいろいろあって。", "zh": "出道对战活动，真是经历了不少辛苦啊。\n也发生了各种各样出乎意料的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "484300e707c602986be277ff65bb41bb26a939a0d30405b57144a5a6fb949503", "ja": "でも、みんなで協力して、俺の予想なんて遥かに超えた\n結果を出してくれたと思う。本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "不过，大家齐心协力，拿出了远远超出我预期的成果。真的辛苦大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "ce363602cbbb732795f99d5b47498eb738c6581dc91c6caedc6adc4f1a518dce", "ja": "ウフフ、つまり予想以上にセクシーだったってことね！\nもう、正直なんだから～♪", "zh": "嘻嘻，也就是说，比预想中还要性感嘛！\n真是的，你可真诚实呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "dcb03c274c9e2ce57d21c7b03dcab1c6314dfd8bfaefd4646347d9dbabd980ee", "ja": "あ、ああ、そう……だな！\nセクシーだったし、何よりみんな、最高に輝いてた！", "zh": "啊、啊啊，也是……呢！\n确实很性感，而且最重要的是，大家都闪耀到了极点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "aa2f31dd5bf2d04dd9644f4b3fca0f82c4f9a3f0b606392dd8482e38059d8644", "ja": "それもこれも、青羽さんが仕立ててくれた\n水着のおかげです。……水着の瑞希、WEBデビュー。", "zh": "这一切都要多亏青羽小姐为我们量身定做的泳装。……穿着泳装的瑞希，正式在网上出道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "55e6bc7942d7b794f166879d34b4d58f594a90f1d6e33c39bf238db4b8eef7b6", "ja": "あはは。水着でデビューって、\nやっぱ最初はちょっと恥ずかしかったんだけど……。", "zh": "啊哈哈。穿着泳装出道，果然一开始还是有点害羞的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "64a5dcfb89c56b500889c5a04c8a9691dfd22cabdad97f8f7a0d5f626eb4315c", "ja": "南の島に行ったら、なんか、これでよかったんだって\n納得しちゃった！　ね、可憐もだよね？", "zh": "去了南方小岛后，不知怎么就觉得，这样也挺好的，彻底想通了！对吧，可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "f24f10f2948dbe68382bc7936fbeeb2627fb2c0dec102c2800e07ecc57901c59", "ja": "は、はい……私も、恥ずかしかったですけど……でも、\nみんなが引っ張ってくれたから、勇気が湧いて……。", "zh": "是、是的……我也觉得很害羞……不过，因为大家拉了我一把，我就鼓起了勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "78b47b8f34d985c14ae05e3eb52b1d32b178954e8887b544d2b02494afdf59cc", "ja": "ううん。可憐の勇気で、みんな一つになれたんだよ。\nそんなデビューイベントだったと思う！", "zh": "才没有呢。正是因为可怜的勇气，大家才能团结一心的哦。\n我觉得这场出道活动就是这样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "7ac00cbb3d63d94bb91c77a2780cce3d1c17b30fd0dff4d4339f2edbe63339c1", "ja": "う、海美ちゃん……！", "zh": "海、海美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "76c3b9a2b0ec21c18cd9fbe0f8316c227606d437bf3a8df8010685a2c52ba47b", "ja": "みんなの頑張りで、本当にいいデビューになったよな。\nだからこそ、すぐ集まってもらうことになったんだ。", "zh": "多亏了大家的努力，这次出道真的很成功啊。正因为如此，才决定马上把大家召集起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "762656a408f1c23615cedae7f995b0dace4bf2ac888ca957b09c260ab5f427a3", "ja": "？　どういうこと、プロデューサー？", "zh": "？什么意思，制作人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1021_se", "source_sha256": "413593a4269905a806a4cc42b6a042a6036312fbc169e01f2c4f86f7d7761ae7", "ja": "（コンコン、ガチャ）", "zh": "（咚咚，咔嚓）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1022_403sor", "source_sha256": "fbba14ccf4f5a8dbc3c6a17a930aca2987f462d9da1e3d0e3666db6b4986cb7e", "ja": "おはようございまーす！\nみなさん、南の島ぶりですね！", "zh": "早上好——！\n大家，自从南方小岛那次之后就没见面了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "e080ac4a16ad430f85df43d8559be7e578f656479174d9d1afc08d09d8c5b263", "ja": "カメラマンさん！？", "zh": "摄影师先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "e080ac4a16ad430f85df43d8559be7e578f656479174d9d1afc08d09d8c5b263", "ja": "カメラマンさん！？", "zh": "摄影师先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d25ef59a8ed53166f28ce66917e2d941172abced1a552a5915c890e7aff8f31", "ja": "カメラマンさん？", "zh": "摄影师先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "e080ac4a16ad430f85df43d8559be7e578f656479174d9d1afc08d09d8c5b263", "ja": "カメラマンさん！？", "zh": "摄影师先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "e080ac4a16ad430f85df43d8559be7e578f656479174d9d1afc08d09d8c5b263", "ja": "カメラマンさん！？", "zh": "摄影师先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1028_403sor", "source_sha256": "0c7879a00736a3c6edf358687198956b8beea945e811cd9a7d9d5cd7dd628365", "ja": "はい、カメラマンの早坂です。\nTeam2ndのみなさん、改めてよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "是的，我是摄影师早坂。  \nTeam2nd的各位，今后还请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1029_null", "source_sha256": "20795544f9441669e821c42de2b57680901af08d4e883054a8c3b9ef7a385459", "ja": "//テロップ風ブック表示『早坂そら』", "zh": "//字幕式书本显示『早坂空』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "f2aa1fc4e07b8ae6f56ab38a9d97d0677b458425159e6bc38d804f7179d51b0c", "ja": "改めてよろしく、ってことは……？", "zh": "重新说“请多关照”，是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "ca60cdab7bbf47d05d4e8d6ba82d2f0b1dbc4b593440799d4b68c70228976095", "ja": "ああ、早坂さんも来てくれたところで、Team2ndの\n新しい仕事について、ミーティングを始めよう！", "zh": "啊，既然早坂小姐也来了，那我们就开始开会，商量一下Team2nd的新工作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "daf1cf00916e0327d9dcaa9f69c8d91ab20d055e0ea1c8acb15d6530af2d0297", "ja": "じつはデビューイベントの配信が終わってすぐ、\n飲料メーカーからオファーをもらったんだ。", "zh": "其实首演活动的直播刚一结束，我们就收到了饮料厂商发来的邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "27a165ee726a60de9aa27917e3cbe1460cd5910b68e2cae462e844e0ec34b459", "ja": "新発売の微炭酸飲料に、\nイメージがピッタリとのことで……", "zh": "据说和新发售的微碳酸饮料形象非常契合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "77068529c9982aab45e8322cdbcaf8359eb6ade1b576561c77ba1d3a9a62d26c", "ja": "デビュー曲と一緒に、5人そろってCM出演決定だ！", "zh": "决定让5人全员一起出演广告了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "a1f8c557ecb7db85e24748550db1b00cce63ec6fb3cc2d36301f89cc9b2fa246", "ja": "し、CMって……あ、あのCM、ですか！？", "zh": "广告、广告是说……啊，是、是那个广告吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1036_401pro", "source_sha256": "8faa6d08e06d37d760f00fe6fb288de47822fd3fd7c64441a9a6b1a796c02014", "ja": "あのCMだ。コマーシャルだぞ！", "zh": "就是那个CM。是电视广告哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "11faf25e1035a7d653f5d6ead3f11c609554c9f129cc4cbbf63573d42b5e51ff", "ja": "うそ！？　それって、\nテ、テレビで流れちゃったりするのっ！？", "zh": "真的假的！？　也就是说，\n会、会在电视上播出来吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1038_401pro", "source_sha256": "2771aba5b1893bd027bae7a845e4dffd8956d167292dbd53570982ea7da7582e", "ja": "ああ、ローカル局だけどな。他にもネットとか、\n街角の大型ビジョンにも展開するそうだ！", "zh": "对，不过只是地方电视台。据说还会在网络上，以及街头的大型屏幕上播放！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "59f1a43b419357a5d851d97ad2bae67a2a64f2c9c706d749e5087622590b8d9c", "ja": "すごいすごーい！\nなんかアイドルのお仕事って感じがする～！", "zh": "好厉害好厉害！\n感觉这才像偶像的工作嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "73e1103908c618a24874c0b7002cc7a0f4566248c53b5d372d365592b460decc", "ja": "今更ですが、自分が芸能人になったという\n実感が湧いてきました……ドキドキ。", "zh": "虽然有点晚了，但我终于有了自己成为艺人的实感……好紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1041_401pro", "source_sha256": "98bd36bf6588c0cfddb357fcfce9e806a06f1054900c0b113da9494914e4320b", "ja": "まあ、まだデビューしたところだもんな。\n正直俺も驚いたけど……。", "zh": "也是，毕竟才刚刚出道嘛。\n说实话我也挺吃惊的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "051dc7f03b5418a91518a7d0deacc1b1127f3947108de25e2ba1609a10dabd5b", "ja": "これはそのデビューイベントで頑張ったからこそ\nつかめたチャンスだと思う。堂々と受けてくれ！", "zh": "我觉得，这是因为你们在出道活动中努力了，才能抓住的机会。请堂堂正正地接受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1043_403sor", "source_sha256": "ebeaa289ee012ea0b80e1a9d08397312bc3a0d12393acc6ac62172c4a64ab335", "ja": "CM撮影は海辺で行うそうで、私も同行して、\nみなさんのいろんな表情を写真に撮らせてもらいます。", "zh": "广告拍摄好像是在海边进行，我也会同行，\n并把大家的各种表情都拍进照片里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1044_403sor", "source_sha256": "d8f8aae12170feae048c83421d5bf635ac4ada7bf7ee983ecc8c097457191ce9", "ja": "楽しそうなオフショットも、最高の一枚も！\nたっぷりいただきますからね！", "zh": "开心的花絮照也好，最棒的一张也好！我都会拍个够哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1045_401pro", "source_sha256": "d14f75ea5a61d3867f16d5172862be5d38a3d910750e3b273038327e9f259777", "ja": "よろしくお願いします、早坂さん。……みんなも\n帰って来たばかりで、慌ただしいと思うけど……。", "zh": "那就拜托你了，早坂小姐。……大家也是\n刚回来，虽然日程可能很匆忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1046_401pro", "source_sha256": "397c429d1b18a3ac0649ff0c336aee898a5bd8b58fb4c6d36b9550d6811fb4a0", "ja": "デビュー直後の注目度の高さは、今しかない強みでも\nある。しっかり取り組んでほしい！", "zh": "出道后的高关注度，也是只有现在才有的优势。希望你们好好把握，认真投入！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "0dab4307c71fa493b522d18dd2e8c23ce592953cf8e3e1de7883f9ff9dcb0434", "ja": "もちろん！　大きな仕事が向こうからぶつかって\n来てくれたんだもん。望むところだよ！", "zh": "当然！大工作主动找上门来了嘛。求之不得啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1048_029umi", "source_sha256": "d22cb970f5164f6ad86d7e63d94a42ece2ffb3942263c505e5c781d776acd75a", "ja": "うんうん！　デビューバトルのクールダウンも、\nとっくに済んでるから大丈夫！", "zh": "嗯嗯！出道对决的冷却时间也早就结束了，所以没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "6583cb7770656b6a0e83b9495db480b0aecfabc50cc810f7273f0abf0ac31173", "ja": "微炭酸飲料だったわよね？　……つまり～♪\nちょっぴり甘くて刺激的な、セクシーの見せ所ね！", "zh": "是微碳酸饮料对吧？……也就是说～♪\n要展现出微甜又带点刺激的性感了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1050_044miz", "source_sha256": "e708b91aff850c3aca294e1f44320d8457d28ff0bca5a8fb3000fac25dd3480f", "ja": "勢いにのっている時に畳みかけるということですね。\n……勝負どころだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "就是说，要趁着气势正盛时一鼓作气地发起攻势吧。\n……现在可是决胜时刻哦，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "ff4ea03cdb63a9bfcb80ce97a8bc70a4a616bcf327d70f77b3575221c63805f7", "ja": "な、なんだか急展開すぎて、目が回りそうですけど……\nで、でも、あの……。", "zh": "进、进展也太快了，感觉都快要头晕了……\n但、但是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1052_045kar", "source_sha256": "19a4ab2a9a07e547832b562d425aa6d5ea06093059e6ce51aa5892cf0214b20a", "ja": "南の島での、みんなとの時間が、\nまだ続いていくみたいで……嬉しいです……♪", "zh": "在南方小岛和大家共度的时光，好像还会继续下去……我很开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1053_029umi", "source_sha256": "96d37ccb05f02856416ace0cf7117aabd9f3299cfe3753cd2e042a4d56555c51", "ja": "あ、私も私も～！　まだ可憐と、Team2ndのみんなと\n一緒にいられるのが、すっっっごく嬉しい！", "zh": "啊，我也是我也是～！还能和可怜、Team2nd的大家一起，真的真的超级开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1054_401pro", "source_sha256": "42d90f44da719dba9a283fb4062c833c142bf5eef32a8e5c1830b3ccc00f2307", "ja": "……うん、全員モチベーションは十分だな！\n南の島の延長戦、みんなで力を合わせて頑張ろう！", "zh": "……嗯，大家的干劲都很足啊！\n南国小岛的加时赛，大家一起齐心协力加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1055_029umi", "source_sha256": "52484f4911620b48a43b9d669f20a6776c03630a13bfbcfbf5b4ae75b4349815", "ja": "はーい☆", "zh": "好～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_intro_1056_046rio", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
